  "details": "Back when the SDK would run in the editor to upload, if a user accidentally tried to upload using the avatar ID owned by another user, it would say so. \n\nToday I had this as a problem and neither the SDK panel nor the log had a clear message. The error that showed up in the SDK panel was \"Application Error\"\n\nThe source of trouble is that sometimes when packing up unity package for an avatar, the author may forget to remove the pipeline id",
